oing awry and murdering patrons, controlled by an evil and murderous hacker who once worked at the company seeking out revenge. Escape evil forces, use strategy to avoid RadioWave and his friends and arrest the hacker while uncovering the mystery. But be careful: don't trust ANYONE. Will you make it out alive?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.poster.avif?t=1768475734\" width=750 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.webm?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.mp4?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want some more enticing action? Enter Custom Mode, a free sandbox mode featuring maps from the Campaign aswell as exclusive mazes for that mode. Choose which robots you want to activate, how aggressive they are and escape the map! Earn more points the more difficult the map is, and get a new highscore or speedrun! Use points and see how you rack up against your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.poster.avif?t=1768475734\" width=750 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.webm?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.mp4?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage scrap in RadioWorld and extract as a Scavenger with others, or kill all the scavengers as a robot of your choice. Communicate with your friends with proximity voice chat! Fun and fast-paced, evade the robots and chase players in large mazes! An active internet connection is required to use this mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/4c088f273a6e6d5451f2360e9f484aad.poster.avif?t=1768475734\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/4c088f273a6e6d5451f2360e9f484aad.webm?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/extras/4c088f273a6e6d5451f2360e9f484aad.mp4?t=1768475734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Redthrower Games"],"dlc":[4052870],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436860/header.jpg?t=1768475734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436860/276920890/01ac54af1af55dc087c3e38aaf3ef63d006a4f49/1753439993/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753537908","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436860/276920890/01ac54af1af55dc08